<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-KAIJA SLIDES ON OFFICIAL LIST, MARKET MIXED.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-KAIJA SLIDES ON OFFICIAL LIST, MARKET MIXED.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fish cannery Kaija began life on the</p>
<p>official list of the bourse with a slide in price to 2.35 lats</p>
<p>from 2.58 lats while Riga Shipyard's second day on the market</p>
<p>saw it slip to 1.40 lats from 1.43 lats.</p>
<p>Shares can be bought (B) or sold (S) at the following prices</p>
<p>and in the following volume, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
